      "calling .item() to convert the datetime64 scalar to a Python object",
      "build or run under UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer (the overflow is undefined behavior)",
      "the arithmetic (*days_) - (365*30 + 7) overflows when *days_ is near INT64_MIN"
    ],
    "input_output_examples": [
